+| policy | mean ops/s | median ops/s | promotion | migration failures |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| off | 2.263B | 2.276B | 0 | 0 |
+| on | 2.303B | 2.305B | 3.460 GiB | 0 |
